{"t":"Pitfall","s":"pitfall-75a44","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Pitfall_f73535.gif","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Pitfall</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Pitfall\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pitfall_f73535.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Navigation<br/>Dropdowns</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mapcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Map Color</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #00cc00; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">October 28, 1997<br/>Alpha 3.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20250902191221&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pitfall_f73535.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a pitfall.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>In caves, or other places around Tibia you can go down.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This is a very tricky tile! If you don't watch out and walk over it you will fall down in a cave with e.g. <a href=\"#/wiki/Dworcs\">Dworcs</a> (a lot of pitfalls in <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>), Chakoyas (near their settlement) or <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quara Scouts</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Talahu\">Talahu</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Malada\">Malada</a>).\n</p>\n<ul><li>Pitfall closes 5 minutes after it's been opened.</li>\n<li>Looking on the closed pitfall results in a message \"You see grass\".</li>\n<li>Closed pitfall will not open if a creature steps on it (attacking a monster standing on a closed pitfall also does not make it open).</li>\n<li>Throwing an item on a closed pitfall does not make it open.</li>\n<li>Closed pitfall will not open if a player climbs up through it from the flower floor.</li>\n<li>It is possible to rope players and items through a pitfall in both stages (opened and closed).</li>\n<li>It is not possible to open a pitfall with a shovel or a pick.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Goblin%20Exile\">A Goblin Exile</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Runaway%20Goblin\">A Runaway Goblin</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/asura-palace-quest\">Asura Palace Quest</a></li><li>Clairvoyant NPCs</li><li>Earth Hole</li><li>Flooring</li><li>Goblin NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Grass%20%28Tile%29\">Grass (Tile)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a></li><li>Guard NPCs</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/krailos-quest\">Krailos Quest</a></li><li>Merchant NPCs</li><li>Navigation</li><li>Plains of Havoc Giant Spider Hole</li><li>Thais Graveyard</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-ape-city-quest\">The Ape City Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-explorer-society-quest\">The Explorer Society Quest</a></li><li>Tiles</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["asura-palace-quest","grimvale-mini-world-change","grimvale-quest","krailos-quest","the-ape-city-quest","the-explorer-society-quest","within-the-tides-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"asura-palace-quest","quest":"Asura Palace Quest","step":"1-1","n":4,"title":"Rés-do-chão: 3 Hydras","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":32942,"y":32677,"z":7,"label":"Pitfall no canteiro de relva"}]},{"slug":"grimvale-mini-world-change","quest":"Grimvale Mini Wor